{res}{txt}
{com}. est store M1
{txt}
{com}. * ==============================================================================
. * 2. Estimate the model using maximum closeness to WOS publications
. * ==============================================================================
. 
. use ${c -(}stata_output{c )-}DID_allfirm-level.dta, clear
{txt}
{com}. reghdfe f_wos_closeness_max did, absorb(firm_id year) vce(r)
{res}{txt}(dropped 207133 {browse "http://scorreia.com/research/singletons.pdf":singleton observations})
{res}{txt}({browse "http://scorreia.com/research/hdfe.pdf":MWFE estimator} converged in 8 iterations)
{res}
{txt}HDFE Linear regression{col 51}Number of obs{col 67}= {res}   445,479
